     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I am pleased to announce the pre-release version of poppr 2.5.0. <b>Details are available at <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.5.0rcv1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.5.0rcv1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480699689000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PFqJdGMtPePv-QsyCiD8M\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.5.0rcv1</a></b></div><div><br></div>It contains a major bug fix for those who deal with polyploid data and Bruvo&#39;s distance with either genome addition or genome loss corrections. It also contains a bug fix for read.genalex. We have ensured that all the new functionality is tested accurately, but nevertheless, <b>if you run into any major bugs or otherwise unexpected results, please open an issue at <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/issues&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480699689000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Xr_oKQpgePhImAu1fARgQ\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/issues</a>.</b><div><br></div><div>I plan to submit the new version to CRAN by next week. If you wish to test out this version before it hits CRAN, and have OSX or Windows, you can install it like so (otherwise, use devtools):<br><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># For OSX users </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/download/v.2.5.0rcv1/poppr_2.5.0rcv1.tgz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/download/v.2.5.0rcv1/poppr_2.5.0rcv1.tgz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480699689000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HkDYrhVDcL1E8FzZz-iIk\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/download/v.2.5.0rcv1/poppr_2.5.0rcv1.tgz</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># For Windows users </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/download/v.2.5.0rcv1/poppr_2.5.0rcv1.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/download/v.2.5.0rcv1/poppr_2.5.0rcv1.zip&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480699689000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hWsVWsIQmjSBfWHJkwW4g\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/download/v.2.5.0rcv1/poppr_2.5.0rcv1.zip</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>Cheers,</div><div>Zhian</div><div><br></div></div>"
